# Bow Data Edge Agent — environment file for `docker run --env-file`.
#
#   cp data_plane/.env.example data_plane/.env    # then edit
#   docker run -d --name bow-edge --env-file data_plane/.env \
#     -p 127.0.0.1:9191:9191 -v edge-data:/data bow/data-edge-agent:dev
#
# Rules for this file (it is read by Docker, NOT a shell):
#   * one KEY=VALUE per line; everything after the first '=' is the value
#   * do NOT wrap values in quotes ("abc" keeps the quotes)
#   * no ${VAR} expansion, no trailing inline comments
#
# Every AgentConfig scalar can be set here; the name is BOW_EDGE_AGENT_<FIELD>
# and the environment wins over any value in a mounted config.yaml. Only
# `connections` cannot come from the environment — that list lives in the YAML
# file (see config.example.yaml). Required vars are uncommented below with
# sample values; optional ones are commented out at their default.
# (docker compose users substitute a different, shorter set into
# docker-compose.yaml instead — see that file.)

# --- identity (must match what Bow provisioned on its broker) ---------------
# Both are NATS subject tokens: no dots, spaces, '*' or '>'.
BOW_EDGE_AGENT_ORG_ID=cust-b
BOW_EDGE_AGENT_EDGE_AGENT_ID=nyc-01
BOW_EDGE_AGENT_EDGE_AGENT_NAME=NYC Office

# --- broker -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Must be TLS-bearing: mTLS is the only authentication and the client cert is
# exchanged in the TLS handshake, so wss:// or tls:// — never plain ws://.
BOW_EDGE_AGENT_TUNNEL_ENDPOINT_URL=wss://tunnel.example.com

# --- mTLS auth (design A11) — the ONLY authentication -----------------------
# The agent presents a client cert during the TLS handshake and the broker maps
# its subject to a scoped user (verify_and_map). There is no token fallback.
# These are PATHS INSIDE THE CONTAINER — mount the PEMs (e.g. -v /host/tls:/tls:ro)
# and point at the mounted paths. tls_cert AND tls_key are both required.
BOW_EDGE_AGENT_TLS_CERT=/tls/edge-agent.pem
BOW_EDGE_AGENT_TLS_KEY=/tls/edge-agent-key.pem
# CA that signed the broker's SERVER cert (a private CA becomes the only trust
# anchor). Omit to verify the broker against the system roots.
BOW_EDGE_AGENT_TLS_CA=/tls/ca.pem
# Verify the broker's server cert. Leave true; false disables server auth
# entirely (local experiments only). Accepts 1/true/yes/on and 0/false/no/off.
# BOW_EDGE_AGENT_TLS_VERIFY=true

# --- admin UI ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Bind all interfaces INSIDE the container; the `-p 127.0.0.1:9191:9191` port
# mapping is what keeps it on the host loopback. Without this the UI is only
# reachable from inside the container and `-p` forwards to nothing.
BOW_EDGE_AGENT_ADMIN_HOST=0.0.0.0
BOW_EDGE_AGENT_ADMIN_PORT=9191
# Turn the admin UI off entirely for a headless, file-only deployment.
# BOW_EDGE_AGENT_ADMIN_ENABLED=true

# --- storage & audit --------------------------------------------------------
# The entrypoint defaults STORE_PATH and AUDIT_PATH under DATA_DIR (which must
# be a volume writable by uid 10001), so you normally set only DATA_DIR.
# BOW_EDGE_AGENT_DATA_DIR=/data
# BOW_EDGE_AGENT_STORE_PATH=/data/edge-agent-store.json
# BOW_EDGE_AGENT_AUDIT_PATH=/data/edge-agent-audit.jsonl
# How many recent audit rows the admin UI keeps in memory.
# BOW_EDGE_AGENT_AUDIT_RETAIN=2000

# --- config file (optional) -------------------------------------------------
# Path to a mounted YAML config for the `connections` list and any non-secret
# defaults; env vars above still override its scalar values. Omit to run purely
# from the environment (no connections until added via the admin UI).
# BOW_EDGE_AGENT_CONFIG=/config/config.yaml

# --- budgets & intervals (optional; seconds) --------------------------------
# BOW_EDGE_AGENT_LOG_LEVEL=INFO
# Per-connection default budget for execute_query.
# BOW_EDGE_AGENT_QUERY_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=300
# Agent-level budget for get_schemas / warm_all (run for minutes).
# BOW_EDGE_AGENT_INDEX_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=900
# How often the advertisement is re-published (NATS core is at-most-once).
# BOW_EDGE_AGENT_ADVERTISE_INTERVAL_SECONDS=60
# Liveness heartbeat cadence.
# BOW_EDGE_AGENT_HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_SECONDS=15
